# ── onlinefdr.com.au repo ignore rules ──
# Added 3 June 2026 so committed junk never recurs.

# macOS Finder metadata (the recurring offender)
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# Windows shell metadata (in case the repo is ever opened on Windows)
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Build-staging files written on the build machine, never part of the live site
*-v2.html

# Editor / temp scratch
*.swp
*.tmp
